# FeedThemAll — Auth API tests
# Extension requise : REST Client (humao.rest-client)
# Clique "Send Request" au-dessus de chaque bloc pour l'exécuter

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### ✅ Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###

### 📝 Inscription — succès attendu : 201 Created + access_token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "moi@fta.dev",
  "username": "MonPseudo",
  "password": "monMotDePasse1",
  "role": "feeder"
}

###

### 📝 Inscription — rôle Giver
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "resto@fta.dev",
  "username": "LeResto",
  "password": "monMotDePasse1",
  "role": "giver"
}

###

### 📝 Inscription — rôle Association
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "asso@fta.dev",
  "username": "AssoProtection",
  "password": "monMotDePasse1",
  "role": "association"
}

###

### ❌ Erreur — email déjà utilisé : attendu 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "moi@fta.dev",
  "username": "AutrePseudo",
  "password": "monMotDePasse1",
  "role": "feeder"
}

###

### ❌ Erreur — mot de passe trop court : attendu 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "court@fta.dev",
  "username": "CourtPass",
  "password": "abc",
  "role": "feeder"
}

###

### ❌ Erreur — rôle invalide : attendu 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@fta.dev",
  "username": "AdminUser",
  "password": "monMotDePasse1",
  "role": "admin"
}

###

### 🔑 Connexion — succès attendu : 200 OK + access_token + cookie refresh_token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "moi@fta.dev",
  "password": "monMotDePasse1"
}

###

### ❌ Connexion — mauvais mot de passe : attendu 401 Unauthorized
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "moi@fta.dev",
  "password": "mauvaisMotDePasse"
}

###

### ❌ Connexion — email inconnu : attendu 401 Unauthorized
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "inconnu@fta.dev",
  "password": "monMotDePasse1"
}

###

### 🔄 Refresh token — attendu : 200 OK + nouvel access_token
# Le cookie refresh_token est envoyé automatiquement par REST Client si tu as fait un login au-dessus
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
